      "html": "<h1>Journey: Fluxo ERP em desenvolvimento (DoD Fase 3)</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ator:</strong> Gestor comercial/financeiro · <strong>Epics:</strong> CRM, FIN, HR, AGENT</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Ciclo completo com orquestrador e human-in-the-loop — <strong>sem</strong> banco nem VPS real.</p>\n",
